  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> »genius« </h1>",
   "body": "<ul><li><strong>Serial number MTST-00251</strong></li><li><strong>Year 2022</strong></li><li><strong>5-axis CNC-version</strong></li><li><strong>Max. tool length Z = 600 mm</strong></li><li><strong>Transversal axis Y ± 50 mm</strong></li><li><strong>Max. Tool Diameter D = 400 mm</strong></li><li><strong>High Precision Spindle »ace« Concentricity 0.002 mm</strong></li><li><strong>Autofocus CNC drive in C axis</strong></li><li><strong>Rotary Spindle Encoder for a high-precision determination of the position in the C axis</strong></li><li><strong>Operating Unit »cockpit« with 24\" TFT touchscreen display</strong></li><li><strong>Tool holders of your choice</strong></li></ul><p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/demonstration-and-used-appliances/sales-inquiry\">Contact ZOLLER sales</a></p>",
